    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57241" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήρυγ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρύσσω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is cried by a
				herald, proclamation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ποιέεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.52
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ κ.</span> by
				<i>proclamation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.78
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλει κ. θεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ κ. ἐμμένειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					350
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				454
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀνειπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.105
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρύσσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.154
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γιγνόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.83
				</span></i>
			; <i>announcement</i> of victory in games, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				63.14
			</span></i>; <i>mandate, summons</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				162
			</span></i> (anap.); <i>reward offered by proclamation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>preaching,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				11.32
			</span></i>,al.</div>
